    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86193" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾰσι-ά</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾰσι-ιή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bed in a garden,
				garden-plot,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				7.127
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				24.247
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.4.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				532
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				24.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				9.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθῶν πρασιαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longus
					4.2
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρασιαὶ πρασιαί</span>
			<i>in companies</i> or <i>groups,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Marc.
				6.40
			</span></i>. (Prob. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράσον,</span> and so
			prop. <i>bed of leeks.</i>) </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a surgical instrument, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hermes</u>
				38.283
			</span></i>.</div>
